{"k":"help.faq.cycle-record-period.question","en":"How do I log my period?"},
{"k":"help.faq.cycle-record-period.subtitle","en":"Add the dates and length of your period."},
{"k":"help.faq.cycle-record-period.answer","en":"In the calendar or the Daily journal, log when your period starts, how long it lasts, and the flow intensity. This information builds your personal history and feeds the estimates shown in AWA."},
{"k":"help.faq.cycle-edit-period.question","en":"Can I edit a period date?"},
{"k":"help.faq.cycle-edit-period.subtitle","en":"Correct a date if your tracking has changed."},
{"k":"help.faq.cycle-edit-period.answer","en":"Yes. Edit the relevant date in your tracking so your history stays accurate to your real cycle. Estimates may then change based on the newly saved information."},
{"k":"help.faq.cycle-predictions.question","en":"How is my next period calculated?"},
{"k":"help.faq.cycle-predictions.subtitle","en":"Estimates based on your own personal history."},
{"k":"help.faq.cycle-predictions.answer","en":"AWA estimates your next period, fertile window and ovulation from your personal history, your cycle length, and the information you log. Estimates are never based solely on a standard 28-day cycle."},
{"k":"help.faq.cycle-flow.question","en":"How do I track my flow intensity?"},
{"k":"help.faq.cycle-flow.subtitle","en":"Log how your bleeding changes."},
{"k":"help.faq.cycle-flow.answer","en":"Use the Daily journal to note your menstrual flow intensity. This keeps a history of how it changes across your cycles."},
{"k":"help.faq.cycle-calendar.question","en":"What do the calendar markers mean?"},
{"k":"help.faq.cycle-calendar.subtitle","en":"Period, fertility, ovulation and the Hijri calendar."},
{"k":"help.faq.cycle-calendar.answer","en":"The calendar shows your logged period days along with your estimated fertile window and ovulation. If spiritual markers are enabled, the Hijri date can also be shown alongside the Gregorian date."},
{"k":"help.faq.conceive-fertile-window.question","en":"How do I know my fertile window?"},
{"k":"help.faq.conceive-fertile-window.subtitle","en":"See the days estimated to be most fertile."},
{"k":"help.faq.conceive-fertile-window.answer","en":"In Trying to Conceive mode, AWA shows an estimated fertile window based on your cycle information and personal history."},
{"k":"help.faq.conceive-ovulation.question","en":"How is my ovulation estimated?"},
{"k":"help.faq.conceive-ovulation.subtitle","en":"An estimate that updates as you track."},
{"k":"help.faq.conceive-ovulation.answer","en":"Ovulation is estimated from the information available in your cycle history. This estimate can change as you add new data."},
{"k":"help.faq.conceive-temperature.question","en":"Can I track my basal temperature?"},
{"k":"help.faq.conceive-temperature.subtitle","en":"Add your temperature to your fertility tracking."},
{"k":"help.faq.conceive-temperature.answer","en":"Yes. Basal temperature tracking is part of the dedicated conception mode."},
{"k":"help.faq.conceive-cervical-mucus.question","en":"Can I track my cervical mucus?"},
{"k":"help.faq.conceive-cervical-mucus.subtitle","en":"Add this observation to your fertility tracking."},
{"k":"help.faq.conceive-cervical-mucus.answer","en":"Yes. Cervical mucus tracking is one of the pieces of information available in Trying to Conceive mode."}
]}